<title>UK: Cap Corp to delay results announcement.</title>
<headline>Cap Corp to delay results announcement.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>British leisure group Capital Corporation Plc, facing a takeover bid, said on Monday that it was postponing announcement of its 1996 results which were earlier due on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The casino operator said it would announce its results after it responds to the offer document from bidder London Clubs International Plc.</p>
<p>London Clubs, which is offering 47 new shares for every 100 Capital shares, is yet to send out the offer document.</p>
<p>London Clubs has not said when it would send out the document.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
